00:03:31.226 --> 00:03:33.202
One of the biggest problems
with a lot of entrepreneurs

00:03:33.202 --> 00:03:35.858
is you're stuck in your current bubble.

00:03:35.858 --> 00:03:37.536
The environment that
you create for yourself

00:03:37.536 --> 00:03:39.468
is holding you back where you are.

00:03:39.468 --> 00:03:40.525
How do you bust through?

00:03:40.525 --> 00:03:41.932
How do you think bigger?

00:03:41.932 --> 00:03:43.125
How do you go out and do something

00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:44.435
that's going to change the world,

00:03:44.435 --> 00:03:47.061
where nobody in your family
has ever done that before,

00:03:47.061 --> 00:03:49.482
