have that kind of ambition?

00:03:49.482 --> 00:03:52.304
So, how do you surround yourself
with those kind of people?

00:03:52.304 --> 00:03:54.266
You read books like this.

00:03:54.266 --> 00:03:55.650
Now, this is one of the first,

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:58.724
