00:12:06.563 --> 00:12:07.731
Now, when people look at my bookshelf,

00:12:07.731 --> 00:12:10.526
you see the Steve Jobs quote
at the top, makes sense.

00:12:10.526 --> 00:12:11.576
You see the books.

00:12:11.576 --> 00:12:12.701
