00:12:12.701 --> 00:12:13.974
And when they look at it,

00:12:13.974 --> 00:12:15.532
they look at the top and they see,

00:12:15.532 --> 00:12:17.836
what the heck is that Three Kingdoms book?

00:12:17.836 --> 00:12:18.998
What is it all about?

00:12:18.998 --> 00:12:21.081
And then, they look below

00:12:22.514 --> 00:12:25.304
and they see this statue,

00:12:25.304 --> 00:12:27.517
and they're wondering what he's all about

00:12:27.517 --> 00:12:29.786
and those little characters underneath

00:12:29.786 --> 00:12:31.340
and what they're all about.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:32.838
So, I have to tell you the story.

00:12:32.838 --> 00:12:34.484
So, Three Kingdoms, also known as

00:12:34.484 --> 00:12:36.187
Romance of the Three Kingdoms,

00:12:36.187 --> 00:12:39.793
is one of the most popular books in China,

00:12:39.793 --> 00:12:41.568
in all of Chinese history

00:12:41.568 --> 00:12:43.893
that has then been translated to English.

00:12:43.893 --> 00:12:45.846
And it'll teach you about leadership.

00:12:45.846 --> 00:12:48.292
It'll teach you about motivating people.

00:12:48.292 --> 00:12:49.591
It'll teach you about having a purpose.

00:12:49.591 --> 00:12:52.749
It teaches you about honesty
and trust and loyalty.

00:12:52.749 --> 00:12:55.570
And it's a story about
three warring kingdoms

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:56.911
at the end of the Han Dynasty

00:12:56.911 --> 00:12:58.653
who are fighting for control of China.

00:12:58.653 --> 00:13:00.815
One of them is led by a man named Cao Cao

00:13:00.815 --> 00:13:03.862
who is evil and lies and cheats and steals

00:13:03.862 --> 00:13:05.927
and does whatever it takes to win.

00:13:05.927 --> 00:13:08.980
And the people hate him
and he's very oppressive

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:10.243
and has tons of rules

00:13:10.243 --> 00:13:13.743
and is the dictator and his way has to go.

00:13:15.453 --> 00:13:17.490
And he's evil and cruel.

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:20.913
And the other side is run
by a guy named Liu Bei,

00:13:20.913 --> 00:13:22.958
who is fair and honest and just

00:13:22.958 --> 00:13:24.985
and treats people with respect

00:13:24.985 --> 00:13:27.428
and people love him and they follow him.

00:13:27.428 --> 00:13:29.665
And he'll never screw people over.

00:13:29.665 --> 00:13:32.548
And these two guys are
constantly fighting.

00:13:32.548 --> 00:13:34.754
And at the start, Liu Bei
is losing all the time.

00:13:34.754 --> 00:13:35.745
He doesn't have the military.

00:13:35.745 --> 00:13:37.226
He doesn't have the money.

00:13:37.226 --> 00:13:38.463
He doesn't have the team.

00:13:38.463 --> 00:13:40.539
And he's always just
retreating and running away.

00:13:40.539 --> 00:13:42.217
And eventually, he builds up his team,

00:13:42.217 --> 00:13:43.367
and the people believe in him.

00:13:43.367 --> 00:13:44.666
And they continue to follow him

00:13:44.666 --> 00:13:46.155
and they love what he's all about.

00:13:46.155 --> 00:13:48.119
And he starts to win.

00:13:48.119 --> 00:13:50.873
And so, it's all about this
fight that continues to happen

00:13:50.873 --> 00:13:52.343
between those two kingdoms

00:13:52.343 --> 00:13:53.650
and another one that's in the third

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.900
that's not as talked about.

00:13:56.934 --> 00:13:58.415
But I love this story.

00:13:58.415 --> 00:14:01.616
It always gives me ideas about strategy,

00:14:01.616 --> 00:14:03.612
about loyalty, about teamwork,

00:14:03.612 --> 00:14:05.303
and I like to pick it up.

00:14:05.303 --> 00:14:06.876
I like to play the video games.

00:14:06.876 --> 00:14:09.567
I like to buy the statues
and decorate the stuff.

00:14:09.567 --> 00:14:11.788
I like to name my products after them.

00:14:11.788 --> 00:14:14.610
The Zhu Ge that I sell
come from this book.

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:17.894
Other companies that I've
started have come from this book.

00:14:17.894 --> 00:14:20.280
And so, it has a lot of
deep personal meaning to me,

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:22.996
and if you're looking for
kind of an off the wall

00:14:22.996 --> 00:14:25.746
fiction book that challenges you,

00:14:27.179 --> 00:14:28.346
that will make you think,

00:14:28.346 --> 00:14:30.943
that will be kind of outside

00:14:30.943 --> 00:14:35.382
the zone of usual
entrepreneur how-to books,

00:14:35.382 --> 00:14:38.379
then check it out, Three Kingdoms.

